    parse_family_strips_option_jit_native_2026-08-02, 0, "RE-SCOPED 2026-11-02 (p12-6, P2): value-level modes fixed (rt_string_parse_int); remaining defect is JIT/native yielding bare scalar/nil instead of Option::Some/None (policy: nil only in unsafe). Checked against current policy/design: re-scoped."

